  m_text: "Eimear was last seen on the road to the bus station but didn't get there.
    \n\nTawley Meats is the only other place on that road.\n\nFactory abandoned in
    '88 for no apparent reason.\n\nStill owned by Tom O'Neill; he keeps it empty."
